r than the fearsome demon, Devilman. However, upon living with Akira's relatives, Devilman has come to find himself rather fond of humanity - even if it means getting roughed up by his girlfriend, the Most Dangerous Miki Makimura for acting out, much to the Demon Lord Xenon's dismay. Wishing to kill the traitor, Xenon begins unleashing a series of cruel, grotesque demons unto Earth, and only Devilman stands between them and humanity's demise. Can the reluctant hero save his soul while keeping the city and his secret identity safe?\n\n(Source: Discotek Media)"},"tags":[{"name":"Demons","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tokusatsu","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kaiju","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Superhero","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Motorcycles","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Delinquents","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Suicide","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Devilman","english":"Devilman","native":"デビルマン","romaji":"Devilman","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"恶魔人"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}